// For the #WCCChallenge, theme: "resistance."
// Better known as the Smith Chart, this is a graphical calculator designed to help electrical engineers 
// analyze complex impedances and reflection coefficients in radio frequency circuits, especially transmission lines.
// Resistance and impedance are different but closely related phenomena. 
// In an AC circuit, impedance combines resistance and reactance.
// I have no idea how to read this chart, but I was intrigued by the look of the graph! 
// Is it a tunnel? a clam shell? the death star? a fountain? You decide!
